\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Latam rallies on Ukraine; Brazil real supported by cenbank\b0\par\par\uc2 567 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 2014\par 18:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par RIO DE JANEIRO, Aug 8 (Reuters) - Latin American stocks and\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gained on Monday as geopolitical tensions related to\par Ukraine eased, while the Brazilian real was further bolstered by\par a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  decision to speed up the rollover of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par swaps, strengthening its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par     Appetite for risk in emerging markets increased globally\par after Russia said it had finished military exercises near its\par southern border. The action had raised fears of a direct\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by Moscow in Ukraine. \par     Benchmark stock indexes in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and Mexico \par rallied over 1 percent, while MSCI's index for Latin American\par equities jumped more than 2 percent.\par     Shares of Brazil's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petr\u243\'00\'F3leo Brasileiro SA\f28 \uc2 \f2 , or \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petrobras\f28 \uc2 \f2 \par , gained 1.4 percent even after the state-run oil\par company posted a larger-than-expected 20 percent slump in \par second-quarter profit late Friday. \par     Some analysts said, despite the profit miss, an increase in\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petrobras\f28 \uc2 \f2 ' oil production was a good development. The company on\par Monday reaffirmed its forecast for a 7.5 percent increase in\par output in Brazil in 2014. \par     Other analysts said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petrobras\f28 \uc2 \f2 ' shares were being driven by\par bets a new government elected in October would change a policy\par that forces the company to sell fuels in the domestic market at\par a loss.\par     In \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, the Brazilian real  gained\par 0.6 percent, also supported by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's decision to\par offer as many as 10,000 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swaps per day to roll over\par contracts maturing on Sept. 1, up from the 8,000 swaps it had\par been offering since the beginning of the month.\par     The move suggested the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was not comfortable with\par a recent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakening that drove the real near the level\par of 2.3 per dollar.\par     "The market is a little less worried about Russia and,\par around here, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  showed its face. That made room\par for a correction in the real," said Reginaldo Siaca, head of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading for Sao Paulo's Advanced Corretora.\par     Siaca believes the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  now wants the real to trade\par within a range of 2.25-2.30 per dollar, weaker than the previous\par range of 2.20-2.25 that was observed during most of the past\par four months. \par     \par   \par     \par     Key Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 1645 GMT\par     \par  Stock indexes                      daily %     YTD %\par                         Latest       change    change\par  MSCI Emerging            1061.26      1.51      4.27\par  Markets                                     \par 