\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  will not change  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  program -source\b0\par\par\uc2 347 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2014\par 22:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background, details, updates price of real through close, paragraphs 6-10)\par \par \uc2 By Patricia Duarte\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, March 26 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no target level intended for its local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and no plans to change its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, a member of the government's economic team told Reuters on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 An initial partial sale of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps - derivatives that provide hedges against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses - raised speculation on Wednesday that Brazilian policymakers could become less aggressive in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the real climbed to four-month highs.\par \par \uc2 "There are no changes (to the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  program) ... There was no message intended, no floor or ceiling for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the official, who asked not to be named in order to speak freely.\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's regular swap auction, in which it sold 2,400 of the 4,000 contracts offered, the bank conducted an additional auction in which it managed to sell the remaining 1,600 contracts.\par \par \uc2 Still, many analysts interpreted the move as a sign that policymakers are not willing to let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gain past the key 2.3-per-dollar level.\par \par \uc2 Although a stronger real helps the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  battle inflation by reducing the price of imports, it also increases costs for local exporters.\par \par \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  cut Brazil's sovereign rating on Monday in part due to the country's inability to bolster an economy that also struggles with high inflation.\par \par \uc2 The official said the bank decided to carry out an additional auction after it first received "bad" price offers for the swaps.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program in August, but slowed its pace this year with policymakers offering $1 billion worth of traditional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps per week.\par \par \uc2 The real closed up 0.5 percent at 2.3064 per U.S. dollar, bouncing from a session low of 2.2926. (Reporting by Patricia Duarte; Writing by Alonso Soto; Editing by Meredith Mazzilli and David Gregorio)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-3-29T21:02:26.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140326ea3q00ueu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
