\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real Stronger On Hopes For Continued  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tom Murphy   \par \uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 2013\par 19:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--The Brazilian real was stronger Tuesday on hopes for continued \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  next year to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real ended active trading at BRL2.3058 against the U.S. dollar, stronger against Monday's close of BRL2.3169, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 In congressional testimony Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Alexandre Tombini re-iterated earlier statements in support of continued \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will unveil details of its strategy for 2014 \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  next week. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is committed to daily auctions of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts through the end of this year.\par \par \uc2 The auctions tend to support the real against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by giving investors the opportunity to exchange bonds indexed to domestic interest rates for paper linked directly to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Federal Reserve Board has signaled its intention to reduce bond purchases at some point in the near future. A reduction in bond purchases would tend to strengthen the U.S. dollar against emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as the Brazilian real.\par \par \uc2 "The real is settling into the year-end value predicted by most analysts, or about BRL2.30 to-the-dollar," said Durval Correa, a trader at Sao Paulo's Multi Money brokerage. With continued government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  assured, there should be little volatility through the end of the year, he added.\par \par \uc2 Write to Tom Murphy at tom.murphy@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 December 10, 2013 13:29 ET (18:29 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020131210e9ca002yg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
