\par\par \b \uc2 Should  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Continue  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\uc2 ? -- WSJ Blog\b0\par\par\uc2 719 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 2013\par 13:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (This story has been posted on The Wall Street Journal Online's Real Time Economics blog at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.wsj.com/economics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.wsj.com/economics}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 By Paulo Trevisani and Jeffrey T. Lewis\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  finds itself caught in a quandary: After launching a new program to prevent the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from depreciating too abruptly during a volatile summer, officials must decide whether to abandon or alter the program now that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is gaining value.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , like many of its counterparts in emerging markets, has struggled for months to cope with the global market turmoil caused by the twists and turns of U.S. monetary and fiscal policy.\par \par \uc2 Its task is complicated because Brazil's inflation, at just under 6%, is running close to the top end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target range. A weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can add to inflationary pressures, but too strong a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can harm the nations' exports.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 --the real--plunged during the summer after the U.S. Federal Reserve signaled it would start winding down some of its easy money policies as the U.S. economy strengthens. The Fed policies had held U.S. interest rates very low for several years, sending global capital flowing to Brazil and other fast-growing developing economies: Those flows started reversing at the prospect of the Fed changing course.\par \par \uc2 Investors in Brazil also feared a shortage of U.S. dollars if the Fed reversed gears too soon and began stocking up on greenbacks--causing the shortage to materialize and the real to fall to a four-year low of 2.45 reais to the dollar by Aug. 22.\par \par \uc2 The next day, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  responded by introducing daily preannounced \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Until that point, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not announced its intentions in advance. The bank said it was just seeking to tame volatility, but many investors saw the moves as an effort to prevent the real from falling any further.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  differ from most other countries in the world, where central banks beef up local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by using dollars from cash reserves. Instead, the \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offers hedging contracts in the futures market-- either of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps or of dollar credit lines--by which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bets on the real and investors can bet on the dollar, easing their fears of getting stuck with a weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 By late August, the new program was working: the real steadied versus the dollar.\par \par \uc2 But suddenly, emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 --including Brazil's--started rising after the Fed surprised markets in September by not pulling back on its stimulus policies, and U.S. budget battles resulted in a 16-day partial shutdown of the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  earlier this month. The Fed left its policies unchanged again at its policy meeting Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The real now trades closer to 2.15 reais to the dollar, versus 2.45 reais when the program began.\par \par \uc2 That appreciation has generated speculation that at some point the real's rise could become a problem, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "I don't think they're in panic mode, but [with the exchange rate] at 2.15 they're starting to get concerned," said Win Thin, an analyst at Brown Brother Harriman in New York.\par \par \uc2 Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Alexandre Tombini signaled earlier this month--during the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  shutdown--that he would press forward with the daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "The program has proved successful in curbing volatility and could be extended beyond year- end if necessary," he said in Washington, DC, on October 12 in his speech during an event sponsored by the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The bank has several options short of cancelling the auctions. When it holds the auctions, for instance, it can simply refuse to accept bids.\par \par \uc2 Tony Volpon, head of emerging-markets research at Nomura Securities in New York, said it would be good for the bank to stick to a predictable course.\par \par \uc2 "Taking away uncertainty is good," he said. "To change now would once again add uncertainty." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  For continuously updated news from The Wall Street Journal, see WSJ.com at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://wsj.com}}}\uc2 \f2 . \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 October 31, 2013 08:42 ET (12:42 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020131031e9av00289\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
