\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Slightly Stronger Ahead of Futures Expiry\b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 2013\par 15:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--The Brazilian real was slightly stronger in early trading Monday ahead of the expiry of monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts.\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL2.2505 to the dollar, stronger against the Friday close of BRL2.2555, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 "It's all about the futures expiry today," said Vanderlei Muniz, partner in southern Brazil's Onnix brokerage. "Holders of long positions are fighting it out with holders of short positions."\par \par \uc2 Monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts expire Tuesday. They will close out based on Monday's average \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, or Ptax rate.\par \par \uc2 Expiry of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts typically brings high volume to Brazil's spot market as holders of short-dollar positions battle with holders of long positions to influence the Ptax rate.\par \par \uc2 Fundamentals are likely to return as the main market influence Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Traders said worries about a looming U.S. budget crisis could bring volatility to trading starting Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue it policy of daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to maintain orderly trading. Later Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will auction the equivalent of $500 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts. The contracts allow investors to exchange bonds linked to domestic interest rates for paper indexed directly to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Tom Murphy at tom.murphy@dowjones.com [ 30-09-13 1300GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130930e99u000l3\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (brazil near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clb